      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "When giving a lecture about the significance of punctuation, the academic professor was interrupted and arrested by the police for murdering his wife, a receptionist of a kindergarten. The police found some photos he deleted from their e-album showing that they used to have a happy life. But, fed up with her wrinkled face, he murdered her instead of divorcing her to avoid fortune division.",
        "zh": "正在讲解标点符号的重要性时，这位学院教授的讲座被打断，他被警方逮捕，因为他谋杀了自己的妻子，她是一名幼儿园接待员。警方找到了他从电子相册中删除的一些照片，显示他们过去曾过着幸福的生活。但他厌倦了她布满皱纹的脸，为了避免离婚时分割财产，他杀害了她，而没有选择离婚。",
